  type: 1
  description: 
  sentences:
    nameNPC: Ta
    Lines:
    - "Qu\xE2n \u0110inh b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u di chuy\u1EC3n. Nh\u01B0ng kh\xF4ng
      ph\u1EA3i ch\u1EA1y lo\u1EA1n, m\xE0 di chuy\u1EC3n theo \u0111\u1ED9i h\xECnh."
    - "\u0110inh Ho\xE0n \u0111\xEDch th\xE2n \u0111\u1EE9ng gi\u1EEFa \u0111\u1ED9i
      h\xECnh, gi\u01A1 c\u1EDD ch\u1EC9 huy. Qu\xE2n cung th\u1EE7 b\u1EAFn t\xEAn
      y\u1EC3m h\u1ED9, qu\xE2n khi\xEAn \u0111\u1EE1 m\u0169i t\xEAn \u0111\u1ECBch,
      qu\xE2n b\u1ED9 r\xFAt lui t\u1EEBng b\u01B0\u1EDBc m\u1ED9t. Tuy ch\u1EADm,
      nh\u01B0ng kh\xF4ng lo\u1EA1n."
    - "Ti\u1EBFng tr\u1ED1ng l\u1EC7nh vang \u0111\u1EC1u \u0111\u1EB7n. Ti\u1EBFng
      h\xF4 \"M\u1ED9t, hai, m\u1ED9t, hai!\" khi qu\xE2n s\u0129 di chuy\u1EC3n."
